# FILESYSTEM PLUGIN - where an image lives on disk
#
#        four defined methods are mandatory, each returns <True|False>,"message":
#        - getpath   the directory of an image, or of one of its tags; the message is the path
#        - clone     copies one image directory onto another
#        - extract   unpacks an image file into an image directory
#        - sync      pulls an image directory from the other controller

# Plugin selection:
#
# the name set as IMAGE_FILESYSTEM under [PLUGINS] in luna.ini,
# e.g. plugins/osimage/filesystem/default.py. There is no search path.
